+    // hangs the X399 (Haiku tears the address space down before it closes the
+    // driver), and a crash ends a process that way. amdgpu lets go of a dying
+    // team's pages first (haiku#38), so on AMD's GPUs this is on unless
+    // SUMMIT_DIRECT_PRESENT_BACK=0; elsewhere it is off unless
+    // SUMMIT_DIRECT_PRESENT_BACK=1, and app_server's copy is kept current by
+    // a frame through app_server now and then instead
+    // (AcceleratedSurface::didRenderFrame).
+    static const bool enabled = [] {
